        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Disposal, CRT screen, 17 inches, to WEEE treatment
mix process of the two disposal ways - the manual dismantling and the mechanical treatment (in a shredder);
UUID: 51f81c15-e7c0-42de-a7f4-a30fe9d4648c
This dataset represents the statistical mixture of the two different disposal ways for WEEE devices in Switzerland.
Location: data of the situation in Switzerland
Technology: current mix of manual and mechanical treatment in Switzerland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 82.5 kt total WEEE
Sampling: statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_51f81c15-e7c0-42de-a7f4-a30fe9d4648c.xml</text>
